        ],
        "text_sha256": "c09af1619f9c59637d33a14642909c4ceba9d16cdebd6971e5413238b7a40a81"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n91-S1凭名目准取；S2物分可取/不可取/无人要；S3拾物先登记；S4旧单带到宝玉。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
