        "text_sha256": "6cc97a13cccbe3c1ca4ba6a3367927bf54834a3c460b0ed70af9841e0f1b3730"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n看守/书办、平儿、凤姐、宝玉、麝月、贾芸。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
